# Build outputs
# NOTE: directory patterns are deliberately NOT bare globs — bare `build/`
# would match scripts/build/ (the canonical build entrypoints referenced
# in CLAUDE.md and every rule file) and silently exclude them from the repo.
# That bug went undetected and meant fresh clones had no way to build.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
/build/
/out/
ext/**/build/
ext/**/out/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# Explicitly track scripts/build/ (build entrypoints) — guard against
# any future broad `build/` rule re-shadowing them.
!scripts/build/
!scripts/build/**

# VS Code workspace — track shared config (settings/launch/tasks/extensions),
# ignore per-user state.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/*.code-snippets

# Native build
ext/libhartonomous/build/
ext/libhartonomous/out/
ext/hartonomous_pg/build/
ext/hartonomous_pg/*.o
ext/hartonomous_pg/*.so
ext/hartonomous_pg/*.dll
ext/hartonomous_pg/*.dylib
*.obj

# Runtime
runtimes/

# Dev
.env
.env.local
*.log
.crash_dumps/

# Data
/data/
/pgdata/
/temp/

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Tooling
TestResults/
coverage/
*.nupkg

# Ops-script outputs
logs/
reports/
artifacts/
exports/

# Claude Code — track project-load-bearing content (rules/, agents/, skills/,
# hooks/, CLAUDE.md, shared settings.json), ignore per-user/runtime state.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/rules/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/commands/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/projects/
.claude/todos/
.claude/cache/
.claude/shell-snapshots/
.claude/statsig/
.claude/ide/
.claude/logs/

# Generator outputs — math-derived UCD/UCA atom blob (per-block files
# total ~91 MB across 397 files). Reproducible from
# scripts/build/generate_unicode_tables.py given the same UCD source.
# Modular property C source (pg_ucd_*.c) IS committed because those
# tables are the API surface and benefit from compile-time inlining.
ext/hartonomous_pg/src/generated/blocks/
ext/hartonomous_pg/src/generated/hartonomous-ucd-*.bin
ext/hartonomous_pg/src/generated/hartonomous-ucd-*.bin.zst
ext/hartonomous_pg/src/generated/hartonomous-ucd-*.bundle.tar.zst
ext/hartonomous_pg/src/generated/hartonomous-ucd-*.idx

# Consolidated extension SQL — assembled at build time from sql/schema/*
# + ext/hartonomous_pg/sql/hartonomous--1.0.sql.in via
# scripts/build/concat_extension_sql.py. Source-of-truth lives in the .in
# template + sql/schema/ tree.
ext/hartonomous_pg/sql/hartonomous--1.0.sql
